<title>POLAND: Kredyt Bank issue oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Kredyt Bank issue oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors subscribed for 10,610,805 shares of Polish Kredyt Bank SA at the bank's 10-million new share issue offered at 8.3 zlotys per share, the bank said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Kredyt Bank also said the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) had signed an agreement on taking 847,000 new shares from a separate Kredyt Bank issue, which will be offered to EBRD on May 5 and 6 at 7.5 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
